flowchart LR
  SOURCE[Tile source] --> L[One transfer interface]
  L --> C[Availability-driven controller]
  C --> B0[Bank 0]
  C --> B1[Bank 1]
  C --> B2[Bank 2]
  C --> B3[Bank 3]
  B0 --> M[Read mux]
  B1 --> M
  B2 --> M
  B3 --> M
  M --> MAC[One MAC consumer]
  MAC --> C
  C --> COUNT[Cycle and completion counters]
